{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10903954097199904852,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Finding the rank of a matrix",
      "source_hash": 12612659676971212155,
      "context_hash": 3867314245566411514,
      "translation": "행렬의 랭크 구하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968602Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**The rank of a matrix** is the largest number of linearly independent rows/columns of the matrix.",
      "source_hash": 16805705030291781422,
      "context_hash": 10547224010828145859,
      "translation": "**행렬의 랭크**는 행렬에서 선형 독립인 행/열의 최대 개수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968603Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The rank is not only defined  for square matrices.",
      "source_hash": 11120924588821758365,
      "context_hash": 363650472670084429,
      "translation": "랭크는 정사각 행렬에 대해서만 정의되는 것이 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968604Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The rank of a matrix can also be defined as the largest order of any non-zero minor in the matrix.",
      "source_hash": 7088667545142904269,
      "context_hash": 11264916360156350896,
      "translation": "행렬의 랭크는 행렬에서 0이 아닌 소행렬식의 최대 차수로 정의할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968604Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Let the matrix be rectangular and have size $N \\times M$.",
      "source_hash": 8899873399274568670,
      "context_hash": 16115657292982649044,
      "translation": "행렬이 직사각형이고 크기가 $N \\times M$이라고 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968605Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Note that if the matrix is square and its determinant is non-zero, then the rank is $N$ ($=M$); otherwise it will be less.",
      "source_hash": 12051602437530061020,
      "context_hash": 7723117021267090557,
      "translation": "행렬이 정사각 행렬이고 행렬식이 0이 아니면 랭크는 $N$ ($=M$)이고, 그렇지 않으면 랭크는 이보다 작다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968605Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Generally, the rank of a matrix does not exceed $\\min (N, M)$.",
      "source_hash": 15028168334634509977,
      "context_hash": 15755170474520612802,
      "translation": "일반적으로 행렬의 랭크는 $\\min (N, M)$을 넘지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968605Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Algorithm",
      "source_hash": 1302133540553668709,
      "context_hash": 14185755831429678221,
      "translation": "알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "You can search for the rank using [Gaussian elimination](linear-system-gauss.md).",
      "source_hash": 7094358053197083213,
      "context_hash": 7366539240662621916,
      "translation": "[가우스 소거법](linear-system-gauss.md)을 사용하여 랭크를 구할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "We will perform the same operations as when solving the system or finding its determinant.",
      "source_hash": 17533374307357785115,
      "context_hash": 2173270217173180703,
      "translation": "연립방정식을 풀거나 행렬식을 구할 때와 같은 연산을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "But if at any step in the $i$-th column there are no rows with an non-empty entry among those that we didn't selected already, then we skip this step.",
      "source_hash": 532008000587947387,
      "context_hash": 9213082617236843264,
      "translation": "하지만 어떤 단계에서 아직 선택하지 않은 행들 중에 $i$번째 열의 원소가 0이 아닌 행이 없으면 그 단계를 건너뜁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Otherwise, if we have found a row with a non-zero element in the $i$-th column during the $i$-th step, then we mark this row as a selected one, increase the rank by one (initially the rank is set equal to $0$), and perform the usual operations of taking this row away from the rest.",
      "source_hash": 6398273950180205665,
      "context_hash": 14446252118743276838,
      "translation": "그렇지 않고 $i$번째 단계에서 $i$번째 열의 원소가 0이 아닌 행을 찾았다면, 이 행을 선택된 행으로 표시하고 랭크를 1 증가시킨 다음(랭크의 초깃값은 $0$입니다), 나머지 행에서 이 행을 빼는 일반적인 연산을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Complexity",
      "source_hash": 3455601846685537577,
      "context_hash": 8098609945626833537,
      "translation": "복잡도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "complexity": "복잡도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This algorithm runs in $\\mathcal{O}(n^3)$.",
      "source_hash": 2130502194076846962,
      "context_hash": 9527814837408218596,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘은 $\\mathcal{O}(n^3)$ 시간에 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:52.968608Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
